    CONSIDER document
    WHEN `s 348(2) another document` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "He is also entitled to be provided by the company with a copy of— (a) the notice of the meeting, and (b) any other communication"
    OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

-- src:4482 | (3) The rights conferred by this section are only to be exercised to the extent that the independent assessor considers necessary for the preparation of his report.
@ref s 348(3) Rights of independent assessor: only as far as necessary (src:4482)
GIVEN `the independent assessor considers the exercise of the right necessary for the preparation of his report` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
