    ELSE IF `the individual is authorised by the firm in writing to act as its representative for that purpose`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "is exercisable by an individual authorised by the firm in writing to act as its representative for that purpose" -- MARGINAL a

