-- src:4496 | (4) A statement made by a person in response to a requirement under this section may not be used in evidence against him in criminal proceedings except proceedings for an offence under section 350 (offences relating to provision of information).
@ref s 349(4) Rights of independent assessor: statements in evidence (src:4496)
GIVEN `the statement was made in response to a requirement under this section` IS A BOOLEAN
